%% ARCnet Commander-in-Control Workflow with HITL Gates and Checkpoints
flowchart LR
  A["Mission Input\nScribe"] --> B[Coordinator]
  B --> C{Mode}
  C -->|Org| O1["Org-Lane Agents\n(status retrieval)"]
  C -->|Mesh| M1["Mesh Specialists\n(similarity-gated)"]
  C -->|Hybrid| H1["Hybrid\n(Org + Mesh)"]

  O1 --> D[Compiler]
  M1 --> D
  H1 --> D

  D --> E["Evaluation\n(COA tournament?)"]
  E -->|Yes| T[COA Generator\nscore & rank]
  E -->|No| P[Proposed Plan]

  T --> G["Approval Gate\n(HITL default)"]
  P --> G
  G -->|Approve| Q[Tasking / Orders]
  G -->|Modify / Reject| B

  subgraph Governance
    K[(Checkpoints / Decision Ledger)]
  end

  A -.-> K
  B -.-> K
  D -.-> K
  E -.-> K
  T -.-> K
  G -.-> K

  classDef gate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#c69500,color:#000;
  class G gate
